---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Mogao Caves Guide 2026 | Tickets, Reservations & Tips for Foreigners"
  description="Complete guide to visiting Mogao Caves in Dunhuang. A-ticket vs B-ticket, how to book as a foreigner, best time to visit, what to expect, alternatives when sold out, and practical tips."
>

  <article class="pt-24 pb-24">
    <div class="section-container max-w-3xl">
      <header class="mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter leading-[1.05] text-stone-900">
          Mogao Caves: The Complete 2026 Guide
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">
          Everything you need to know about visiting one of the world's greatest Buddhist art treasures: ticket types, how to book, what to expect inside, and how to plan your visit as an international traveler.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Hero Image -->
      <div class="mb-16 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/mogao-caves.webp" alt="Mogao Caves nine-story temple facade with ancient Buddhist grottoes carved into desert cliff, Dunhuang" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" width="1200" height="1200" loading="eager" decoding="sync" sizes="100vw" />
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Facts -->
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Location</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-semibold text-stone-900">25km SE of Dunhuang</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Open</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-semibold text-stone-900">Year-round</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Visit Duration</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-semibold text-stone-900">3-4 hours</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Peak Season</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-semibold text-stone-900">May to October</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- A vs B Tickets -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 mb-6">A-Ticket vs B-Ticket: What You Need to Know</h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Mogao Caves operates a tiered ticket system designed to manage visitor flow and protect the fragile murals. Understanding the difference is essential for planning your visit.
        </p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-mogao-50/50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-mogao-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-mogao-700 mb-3">A-Ticket (Standard)</h3>
            <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-mogao-600 mb-4">$35-40</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-mogao-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>8 caves with a guided tour</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-mogao-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Includes 2 film screenings at the Digital Exhibition Center</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-mogao-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>English-speaking guides available</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-mogao-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Must book 1-4 weeks in advance in peak season</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-mogao-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Daily limit: 6,000 visitors</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-stone-100 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-stone-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-700 mb-3">B-Ticket (Emergency/Off-Peak)</h3>
            <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-stone-600 mb-4">$15-20</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-stone-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>4 caves only</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-stone-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>No film screenings included</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-stone-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Limited English guide availability</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-stone-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Only sold when A-tickets are sold out</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-stone-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Available same-day at the visitor center</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl">
          <p class="text-sm text-amber-800 font-semibold">Peak Season Warning</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-amber-700">During July, August, and Chinese national holidays (particularly Golden Week in early October), A-tickets can sell out 2-4 weeks in advance. Book as early as possible.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- How to Book -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 mb-6">How to Book as a Foreigner</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
          <p>The official booking platform is the <strong class="text-stone-900">Mogao Caves Visiting Reservation System</strong>. Here is how to navigate it as a non-Chinese visitor:</p>
          <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-3 ml-2">
            <li><strong class="text-stone-900">Use the official WeChat mini-program</strong>. Search for "莫高窟参观预约" in the WeChat app. The mini-program has an English interface option.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-stone-900">You need a Chinese phone number</strong>. The system requires SMS verification. Buy a local SIM card upon arrival or ask your hotel to help.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-stone-900">Passport number is required</strong>. Enter your passport details exactly as they appear. This will be checked at the entrance.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-stone-900">Select a time slot</strong>. A-ticket time slots fill quickly. Morning slots (8:00-10:00) are best for avoiding crowds and afternoon heat.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-stone-900">Alternative: Use Trip.com or a local travel agency</strong>. They can book on your behalf for a small service fee and handle the language barrier.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-stone-900">Payment</strong>. WeChat Pay (with a linked foreign card via Alipay International) or a Chinese bank card. Cash is not accepted for online bookings.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- What to Expect -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 mb-6">What to Expect Inside</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
          <p>The visit follows a structured flow:</p>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-mogao-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Digital Exhibition Center</p>
                <p class="text-sm">Two 20-minute films introduce the history of the Silk Road and the caves. The second film is in a 360-degree dome theater. A-ticket holders see both films.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-mogao-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Shuttle Bus to the Caves</p>
                <p class="text-sm">A 15-minute bus ride from the Digital Center to the actual cave complex. Buses run continuously.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-mogao-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Guided Cave Tour</p>
                <p class="text-sm">Groups of 20-25 visitors are assigned a guide. You visit 8 caves over approximately 75 minutes (A-ticket). The caves you see are rotated to minimize damage. Guides carry flashlights; the caves are dark to protect the pigments.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-mogao-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Free Time & Museum</p>
                <p class="text-sm">After the guided tour, you can explore the site on your own. Visit the on-site museum, the research institute shop, and the iconic nine-story facade (Cave 96).</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl">
            <p class="text-sm text-red-800 font-semibold">Photography is strictly forbidden inside the caves.</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-red-700">No exceptions. Flash photography and even non-flash photos damage the ancient pigments. Cameras must be stored during the tour. Phone use is also restricted. You can photograph the exterior of the caves, the nine-story facade, and the surrounding landscape.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Alternatives -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 mb-6">Alternatives When Mogao Is Sold Out</h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          If A-tickets and B-tickets are both gone, do not panic. Two excellent alternatives are within easy reach:
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-stone-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Yulin Caves</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600">Located 170km east of Dunhuang. Contains 42 caves with murals comparable in quality to Mogao but far fewer visitors. You can often enter caves here that would be closed to the public at Mogao. Allow a full day for the trip.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-stone-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Western Thousand Buddha Caves</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600">Only 35km from Dunhuang. 16 surviving caves with murals spanning from the Northern Wei to the Yuan dynasties. Much smaller scale but often completely empty of tourists. Combine with a visit to Yumen Pass for a day trip.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Practical Tips -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 mb-6">Practical Tips</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-stone-600">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" class="text-mogao-600"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong class="text-stone-900">Bring a jacket</strong>. The caves maintain a constant cool temperature around 15&deg;C (59&deg;F) year-round. Even in summer, you will want a layer inside.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" class="text-mogao-600"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong class="text-stone-900">Wear comfortable shoes</strong>. You will walk and stand for 2-3 hours. The cave complex has stairs and uneven surfaces.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" class="text-mogao-600"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong class="text-stone-900">Bring your passport</strong>. The name on your ticket must match your passport. You will be asked to show it at the entrance checkpoint.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" class="text-mogao-600"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong class="text-stone-900">Morning visits are best</strong>. Light is optimal, crowds are thinner, and you avoid the afternoon desert heat. Book the earliest slot you can get.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" class="text-mogao-600"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong class="text-stone-900">No large bags</strong>. Backpacks and large bags must be stored in lockers at the entrance. Bring a small cross-body bag for essentials.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="bg-mogao-600 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Ready to plan your visit?</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-mogao-100 text-sm">Use our itinerary planner to fit Mogao Caves into your Silk Road journey.</p>
        <a href="/#planner" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-5 px-5 py-3 bg-white text-mogao-700 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-mogao-50 transition-colors">
          Open Trip Planner
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
      <section class="mt-16 p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 reveal">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-3">Sources &amp; References</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-600">
          <li>&rarr; <a href="https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/440/" rel="external nofollow" target="_blank" class="text-mogao-600 hover:text-mogao-700 underline">UNESCO World Heritage: Mogao Caves</a> — official listing since 1987</li>
          <li>&rarr; <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mogao_Caves" rel="external nofollow" target="_blank" class="text-mogao-600 hover:text-mogao-700 underline">Mogao Caves on Wikipedia</a> — comprehensive history and cave descriptions</li>
          <li>&rarr; Ticket prices verified at the Mogao Caves ticket office, July 2026</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
  
  </article>
</BaseLayout>


